<title>USA: Amex names new president of Brazil unit.</title>
<headline>Amex names new president of Brazil unit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Express Co said Thursday it had named Helio Lima president of American Express-Brazil.</p>
<p>Lima takes over from Roberto Cavalcanti, American Express president for Latin America and the Caribbean, who had been acting president of Brazil since January, the company said.</p>
<p>Among his previous positions, Lima was president of Credicard in Brazil and president of Citibank in Puerto Rico and Florida.</p>
<p>No further information was immediately available.</p>
</text>
